# Fuzz build output (its own target dir, outside the workspace's /target).
/target
# libFuzzer's raw crash/timeout/oom dumps. Reproducers we keep are MINIMIZED and committed under
# findings/<target>/ instead; the raw artifacts/ pile is throwaway.
/artifacts

# NOTE: corpus/<target>/ is deliberately NOT ignored — the small committed *seed* corpus is tracked.
# A coverage-guided run on a CI agent will grow these dirs with discovered inputs; prune before
# committing (keep the seeds) or add a corpus-pruning step to the scheduled job.
